<%# See the note in #new: both pages carried their title as an `h2` inside a card that wrapped a form which
    renders its own card.

    The title is "Edit portfolio transaction", not "Edit Portfolio Transaction #215". Sentence case, per the
    copy rule - and the id moves to the breadcrumb, where the other admin edit pages already put the record's
    identifier. A heading is not the place to state a database id twice. %>
<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
  <%= admin_breadcrumbs(@breadcrumbs) %>

  <%= render layout: "components/ui/page_header",
             locals: { title: "Edit portfolio transaction" } do %><% end %>

  <%= render "form", portfolio_transaction: @portfolio_transaction %>
</div>
